diff --git a/skills/onshape-native-modeling/SKILL.md b/skills/onshape-native-modeling/SKILL.md
index d806048..d6cdd84 100644
--- a/skills/onshape-native-modeling/SKILL.md
+++ b/skills/onshape-native-modeling/SKILL.md
@@ -28,6 +28,32 @@ verify saved solid geometry and human editability. If the tool returns
 `needs_readback`, inspect the pinned journal and exact editor state; never invoke
 the tool again on that target until the uncertain operation is reconciled.
 
+The standalone MCP plate command does not yet orchestrate the normal browser
+selection needed between saving the sketch and starting Extrude. For this H2
+workflow, use the official Browser plugin as the trusted-input step; do not
+substitute synthetic DOM clicks or a REST write fallback. After the sketch is
+positively reconciled as observed and the journal has no unresolved write:
+
+1. Read the exact target and saved sketch feature ID from native readback and
+   its matching sketch journal operation. Verify the same document, workspace,
+   Part Studio and idle editor through the Browser plugin.
+2. Inspect the current DOM and find the unique visible source sketch row. Use
+   normal Browser input to select that observed row. Verify that it is the
+   only visible `div.os-list-item.selected[feature-id]`, with the exact source
+   feature ID; preserve an already-correct selection. Recheck revision and idle
+   state. Do not guess a feature ID, selector match, or screen coordinate.
+3. Continue with the installed H2 CLI:
+   `h2cad experimental-create-plate SOURCE --did DID --wid WID --eid EID --bridge-config CONFIG --tab-id TAB --journal JOURNAL --resume-sketch-op-id OBSERVED_SKETCH_OP`.
+   Use the original source and pinned journal/config. This resumes only after
+   a saved sketch and before any extrusion exists; it does not replay sketch
+   creation or recover a partially submitted extrusion. Reconcile uncertain
+   writes before further modeling, and use their exact existing operation IDs.
+
+`source_sketch_selection_required` is a pre-dispatch selection diagnostic, not
+evidence of created geometry. The bridge rechecks the exact selected source
+before initiating Extrude. Agent-orchestrated Browser selection is currently
+required; do not describe the standalone plate tool as fully autonomous.
+
